# Agent Workflow Rules

- Orchestrator routes to sub-agents — sub-agents never call each other directly
- Approval gates use LangGraph interrupt — never bypass (see ADR-0003)
- Request Events are append-only — never mutate past events
- Phase 1 uses mock pipeline only — no real Power BI MCP until Phase 2 issue exists
- Use domain terms from `CONTEXT.md` in code and APIs
